WEBVTT

00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:32.987
Growing up,

00:00:33.029 --> 00:00:35.782
I took solace in the books
that I would read,

00:00:35.823 --> 00:00:39.786
and those book characters
that I met offered me friendship.

00:00:41.621 --> 00:00:43.081
Characters like Ralph S. Mouse

00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:45.708
from Beverly Cleary's
"The Mouse and the Motorcycle."

00:00:46.793 --> 00:00:48.669
Snoopy, Garfield.

00:00:50.922 --> 00:00:55.635
They offered me companionship
as I dealt with the trauma

00:00:55.635 --> 00:01:00.973
of my mother's lifelong struggle
with an opioid addiction,